  "question": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\qt0017_a232467f367d.png\"/><br/>A spherical surface separates two media of refractive indices 1 and 1.5 as shown in figure. Distance of the image of an object ' O ', is :<br/>( C is the center of curvature of the spherical surface and $R$ is the radius of curvature)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "0.24 m right to the spherical surface",
