  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{\\mu_2}{\\mathrm{v}}-\\frac{\\mu_1}{\\mathrm{u}}=\\frac{\\mu_2-\\mu_1}{\\mathrm{R}} \\\\ & \\frac{1.5}{\\mathrm{v}}-\\frac{1}{(-0.2)}=\\frac{1.5-1}{0.4} \\\\ & \\frac{1.5}{\\mathrm{v}}=\\frac{0.5}{0.4}-\\frac{1}{0.2} \\\\ & \\frac{1.5}{\\mathrm{v}}=-\\frac{1.5}{0.4} \\\\ & \\mathrm{v}=-0.4 \\mathrm{~m}\\end{aligned}$"
